TEST (10x20) bars: key strips: color1 c0 r0-r1 (length2); color2 c1 r0 (length1); color3 c2 r0-r2 (length3); color4 c3 r0 (length1). Bottom bars: c1 endpoint2 top r4, 5 at r5-r8, bottom r9; c3 endpoint4 at r5/r9 with NO interior; c6 endpoint3 r7/r9 with 5 r8; c8 endpoint3 r3/r9 with 5 r4-r8; c10 endpoint3 r6/r9 with 5 r7-r8; c13 endpoint2 r7/r9 with 5 r8; c15 endpoint4 r7/r9 with 5 r8; c16 endpoint1 r1/r9 with 5 r2-r8; c18 endpoint1 r4/r9 with 5 r5-r8. Also c19 has 1 at r6 and 5 r7-r9, no bottom endpoint 1; c0/c2/c3 are keys.

REJECTED OUTPUTS, expressed only as WHICH TEST INTERIOR RUNS WERE RECOLORED (everything else unchanged):
1 {c1,c8,c18}
2 {c8,c18}
3 {c18}
4 {c1,c6,c8,c10,c15,c16,c18}
5 {c1,c8,c10,c16,c18}
6 {c1,c8,c10,c18}
