8 {c6,c8,c10,c15,c18}
All eight were incorrect. Do not repeat these subsets.

Failed hypotheses included: fill medium-length bars only; fill bars with height 4-7; fill only c18; fill every non-color-2 bar plus longer color-2 bars; selecting top-N bars per endpoint color from key height. The correct rule remains unknown. Future agent should focus on the exact meaning of the top key-strip lengths and possibly interactions among bars/keys rather than simple height thresholds.'''
)
print(entry)

